  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "57cf14c3-aaf6-50c7-b9d4-ee5b65a9cbb2",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -3 & 3 \\\\ 9 & 6 & 9 \\\\ 1 & 5 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -2 & -9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $L,M,$ and $N?$\n\nI. The product $ML$ is well defined\n\nII. The product $MN$ is well defined\n\nIII. The product $LM$ is well defined",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $L$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix, $M$ is a $3\\times 1$ column vector, and $N$ is a $1\\times 3$ row vector.\n\nThere is $1$ column in $M$ and $3$ rows in $L.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $L,$ the matrices $M$ and $L$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{3\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{L}_{3\\times 3}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there is $1$ column in $M$ and $1$ row in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ equals the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $M$ and $N$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{N}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 3}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $3$ columns in $L$ and $3$ rows in $M.$ Since the number of columns in $L$ equals the number of rows in $M,$ the matrices $L$ and $M$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{L}_{3\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{M}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 1}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statements II and III are true, while statement I is false.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "fa8dfa58-40d2-5795-9855-8b0fa22e1906",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "742f42fe-45a3-5115-bb8c-8eb83f43e1df",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "e5f536fa-d86b-5789-9971-1d9e658d898d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "baf5066b-587b-5f3b-be1b-72f16abe9da5",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a2f4d0d1-5ce9-5dcc-81d3-29ac7a7480eb",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "29d9d5e2-0d19-59e2-aba9-3196eb466a39",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            }
