    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "0bc031ec-8f80-5ea3-b5a2-a86da742b6dd",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -5 & 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 7 \\\\ 5 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $L,M,$ and $N?$\n\nI. The product $LN$ is well defined\n\nII. The product $NM$ is well defined\n\nIII. The product $NL$ is well defined",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $L$ is a $1\\times 4$ row vector, $M$ is a $2\\times 1$ column vector, and $N$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nThere are $4$ columns in $L$ and $2$ rows in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $L$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $L$ and $N$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{L}_{1\\times 4}{\\times }_{\\ne }{N}_{2\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $N$ and $2$ rows in $M.$ Since the number of columns in $N$ equals the number of rows in $M,$ the matrices $N$ and $M$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{N}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{M}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 1}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $N$ and $1$ row in $L.$ Since the number of columns in $N$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $L,$ the matrices $N$ and $L$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{N}_{2\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{L}_{1\\times 4}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement II is true, while statements I and III are false.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "cdd1f442-21be-5838-ac69-dca688284a27",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "7f277bc9-0113-5fee-8a8b-29620fb04fb4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "8d580dc0-12dd-5d06-bce7-aebe01aeb05b",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "a4eabdbd-ff8d-5685-a85c-63fcfc9d2e3e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "41c0b061-4b7e-561b-bf28-11ff37d30d8a",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "142f55a5-fe32-596e-a2c8-5f2733c16c70",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            }
          ],
