    "question": {
      ":question/id": "a21a5dbc-9184-53eb-8c5e-fd9c6071c083",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $P,R,$ and $S?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $P$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, $R$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $S$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $2$ columns in $S$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $S$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $S$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{2\\times 2}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $2$ columns in $P$ and $2$ rows in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ equals the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $P$ and $S$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{S}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $2$ columns in $R$ and $2$ rows in $S.$ Since the number of columns in $R$ equals the number of rows in $S,$ the matrices $R$ and $S$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{R}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{S}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 2}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe products $PS$ and $RS$ are well defined. The product $SP$ is undefined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "edfbc068-38d0-5dd3-b31c-7af254d16c76",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $SP$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "6a217ee8-0f4d-56f8-98f1-e724e2a499b4",
