  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "75208fba-58dc-5063-a3a5-449815287ceb",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$O=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -1 & 2 & -9 & -5 \\\\ 7 & -7 & -8 & 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$P=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & -8\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$R=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -4 & 9 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 & -3 \\\\ -3 & 5 & 8 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 9 & 3 & 8 \\\\ 4 & -2 & -2 & -6\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $O,P,$ and $R?$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $O$ is a $2\\times 5$ matrix, $P$ is a $1\\times 2$ row vector, and $R$ is a $5\\times 4$ matrix.\n\nThere are $2$ columns in $P$ and $2$ rows in $O.$ Since the number of columns in $P$ equals the number of rows in $O,$ the matrices $P$ and $O$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{P}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{2}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{O}_{\\boxed{\\text{2}}\\times 5}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $5$ columns in $O$ and $1$ row in $P.$ Since the number of columns in $O$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $P,$ the matrices $O$ and $P$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{2\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{P}_{1\\times 2}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $5$ columns in $O$ and $5$ rows in $R.$ Since the number of columns in $O$ equals the number of rows in $R,$ the matrices $O$ and $R$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{O}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{5}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{R}_{\\boxed{\\text{5}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nThe products $PO$ and $OR$ are well defined. The product $OP$ is undefined.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "7a6ce98f-ab2c-55a7-8e39-7d98ecfe8f30",
          ":answer-field/key": "The product $PO$ is well defined.",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
