  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186100869,
      "id": "b494140f-206a-5317-8079-ff719a253140",
      "title": "Determining Whether Two Matrices Are Conformable for Multiplication"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "f52e60bc-b6e3-540b-bae6-e31aa9e611e6",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & 3 & 2 & 8 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -6 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & -5 & 5 & -7 & -6 \\\\ 3 & 0 & -4 & 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $L,M,$ and $N?$\n\nI. The product $LN$ is well defined\n\nII. The product $MN$ is well defined\n\nIII. The product $NM$ is well defined",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $L$ is a $1\\times 5$ row vector, $M$ is a $5\\times 1$ column vector, and $N$ is a $2\\times 5$ matrix.\n\nThere are $5$ columns in $L$ and $2$ rows in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $L$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $L$ and $N$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{L}_{1\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{N}_{2\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there is $1$ column in $M$ and $2$ rows in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $M$ and $N$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{5\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{N}_{2\\times 5}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $5$ columns in $N$ and $5$ rows in $M.$ Since the number of columns in $N$ equals the number of rows in $M,$ the matrices $N$ and $M$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{N}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{5}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{M}_{\\boxed{\\text{5}}\\times 1}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statement III is true, while statements I and II are false.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "4f4ba468-7e76-50b9-9b09-06ca752c89b4",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "9e836c94-a8d6-5e2f-b25c-2d9b2ef18824",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "966182cc-2839-59f9-9c73-46e07285863d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "18a660b1-ae9a-5b76-8409-8a973e6a866e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "5d5f3a05-b2b9-5d95-b188-9076c6cd8cd8",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "1aef49ce-a636-596b-b48a-f687b42500ab",
