    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "39d9285d-223e-502b-bc67-b62e90cd502a",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "<div class=\"matrix-operands\">\n<div>$L=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 & 5 & -4 \\\\ -8 & -1 & 5 & 7 \\\\ -4 & 9 & -8 & -5 \\\\ 8 & 8 & 3 & 7 \\\\ 0 & 9 & 3 & -5\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 9 & 0 & -9 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}-8 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the matrices $L,M,$ and $N?$\n\nI. The product $MN$ is well defined\n\nII. The product $LN$ is well defined\n\nIII. The product $ML$ is well defined",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Notice that $L$ is a $5\\times 4$ matrix, $M$ is a $1\\times 5$ row vector, and $N$ is a $4\\times 1$ column vector.\n\nThere are $5$ columns in $M$ and $4$ rows in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ does **not** equal the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $M$ and $N$ are **not** conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{1\\times 5}{\\times }_{\\ne }{N}_{4\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$\n\nOn the other hand, there are $4$ columns in $L$ and $4$ rows in $N.$ Since the number of columns in $L$ equals the number of rows in $N,$ the matrices $L$ and $N$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{L}_{5\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{N}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 1}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nFinally, there are $5$ columns in $M$ and $5$ rows in $L.$ Since the number of columns in $M$ equals the number of rows in $L,$ the matrices $M$ and $L$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{M}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{5}}}{\\times }_{\u2713}{L}_{\\boxed{\\text{5}}\\times 4}=\\text{well defined}\n$$\n\nTherefore, statements II and III are true, while statement I is false.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "39d1d84d-02f8-5c60-936f-0fb0d10709b9",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "8e14b5b7-9c66-557e-b186-b6b206078bc0",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "822174c3-a7df-5272-868c-d07a5efd50b4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "66347db8-9401-52e9-b9cf-8f38ee08f6f9",
